{"id":"steam-2659410","steam":2659410,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Elta: Defy All Gods","summary":"Brawl your way out of corrupted worlds alongside your dragon-god companion in an adrenaline-fueled action-platformer blending free-form melee combat, fluid platforming and sci-fi exploration. Become the champion of your fallen god, Elta.","about":"Chosen by your people to seek your lost god, you find yourself stranded on a hostile planet. With no way home, fight your way out alongside your newfound draconic companion. Slam every foe, defeat every god, brawl your way out of each challenge and escape - no matter what stands in your way\nElta: Defy All Gods is an adrenaline-fueled action-platformer from Afterburner Studios, the indie team behind Dreamscaper. Master a blend of free-form melee combat, fluid platforming and sci-fi exploration to embark on a divine mission to restore your god’s powers and save your people.\n\nEngage in dynamic free flow combat and master three martial art stances in explosive group fights. Switch techniques on the fly to shatter enemy defences, build up energy to unleash devastating magic attacks, and dispatch survivors in style with anime-inspired finishers.\n\nExplore three sprawling worlds featuring derelict temples and industrial ruins, all filled with hidden paths, secrets and collectibles. Weave your way across icy cliffs, desert canyons and cloud islands thanks to an evolving traversal toolkit. Flow through challenging courses by chaining double jumps, air dashes, wall runs, and more.\n\nUnlock lethal fighting moves to expand your melee arsenal and find new traversal technology while exploring to reach new heights. As you get more powerful and defeat dangerous foes, Elta will evolve alongside you toward their true form, gaining versatile elemental abilities in the process.\n\nYou are a warrior monk hailing from a nomadic civilization, exiled from its home world for centuries. Your mission is paramount: find a place where your people belong. Your only hope is to find Elta, restore their former power and defeat the corrupted gods ruling these decrepit worlds.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/5a4696e12a04c88821354043bbd5889b43f28381/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794230229","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/b6b5c2d1f413b7b1d300d652ca9ff5679d47249f/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1794230229","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/01c1bea707cf57591d99d9853ce8d4de68986c1b/library_hero.jpg?t=1794230229","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/b6b5c2d1f413b7b1d300d652ca9ff5679d47249f/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1794230229","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/bf36e2a2cc2268fbf2c98f4f7925e530fc6ba525/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794230229","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/98ff27b1a174a2fb40de54f314504db30d2d81cb/ss_98ff27b1a174a2fb40de54f314504db30d2d81cb.600x338.jpg?t=1794230229","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/98ff27b1a174a2fb40de54f314504db30d2d81cb/ss_98ff27b1a174a2fb40de54f314504db30d2d81cb.jpg?t=1794230229"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/1d9647e2f74214e02d4a1f8c231bc9e2c428520e/ss_1d9647e2f74214e02d4a1f8c231bc9e2c428520e.600x338.jpg?t=1794230229","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/1d9647e2f74214e02d4a1f8c231bc9e2c428520e/ss_1d9647e2f74214e02d4a1f8c231bc9e2c428520e.jpg?t=1794230229"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659410/193c7c98d5195f5aa607d68da99df1ed25949e16/ss_193c7c98d5195f5aa607d68da99df1ed25949e16.600x338.jpg?t=1794230229","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265941